  "summary": "KMC Conquest controllers ship with a default application per equipment type. This table lists the objects of the Pressure Independent Vav, Dual Duct application: inputs, outputs, setpoints and configuration values, binary flags and multi-state modes, with their factory defaults. Conquest controllers talk BACnet MS/TP, and the Ethernet models BACnet IP.",
